__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
**/.nfs*

# run output: trajectories, movies and logs (`--output_root .` writes here)
graphs_data/
log/

# experiment records: the specs and the why notes are tracked; movies, stills, the panes the viewer draws (story/) and the notes (experiments/*.md) are not
experiments/*/mp4/
experiments/*/png/
experiments/*/data/*.png
experiments/*/data/*.mp4
experiments/*/story/
experiments/*.md
!experiments/INSTRUCTION.md

# simulation data, except the seed tables the record specs read
*.npz
*.npy
!experiments/*/data/seed_*.npz
# the seed tables over 50 MB are written by their record's tool, not stored: `python tools/exp09_landscape.py write a100k` (exp10's are packed by `generate` itself)
experiments/exp09_molecular_landscape/data/seed_a100k.npz
experiments/exp09_molecular_landscape/data/seed_b1m.npz
experiments/exp09_molecular_landscape/data/seed_b10m.npz

# drafts the GUI writes from a prompt
config/studio/
